WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:26.985
A goldfish.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.291
It's stuck.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.101
That was weird.

00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:11.821
Ow!

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:16.367
Is it dead?

00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:22.457
It licked my finger. It's alive!

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.629
Sosuke, we're leaving!

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:31.549
Lisa, I caught a goldfish!

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:43.478
This wind feels strange.  

00:01:43.812 --> 00:01:46.314
Sosuke, I'm starting the car!

